            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains iconicity ratings and response times for 415 signs in NGT (Sign Language of the Netherlands/Dutch Sign Language). <br>\nThere are five documents in this repository:<br>\n(1) Iconicity ratings<br>\n(2) Response times<br>\n(3) Summary description of participants<br>\n(4) Questionnaire<br>\n(5) Instruction videos in NGT<br>\n<p>\nThe documents (1) and (2) contain data from the same 23 deaf signers. Response times are for the iconicity ratings. The videos referred to in the CSV files are in a separate repository, \"NGT video stimuli, with and without mouth actions\" here: https://doi.org/10.17026/SS/CNQGSY"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
